<atten3>
<ptxt>The reference pages for when the above codes are output apply only when they are output by the main body ECU (MS bus monitoring ECU). If they are output by an ECU other than the main body ECU, it is necessary to identify the malfunctioning area from "How to Proceed with Troubleshooting".</ptxt>
</atten3>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If a communication stop or bus malfunction occurs in an ECU connected to the MS bus, the main body ECU detects the malfunction and outputs a DTC.</ptxt>
</atten4>
